### The caller's bell: pushed notifications and announcements, newest first, plus the unread count
GET {{baseApiPath}}/notifications

### Mark one entry read (kind is NOTIFICATION or ANNOUNCEMENT)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/notifications/NOTIFICATION/1/read

### Mark everything read
POST {{baseApiPath}}/notifications/read-all

### List all announcements (administrators)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/announcements

### Publish an announcement for every user (expiresAt is optional)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/announcements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ausgabe geschlossen",
  "message": "Am Freitag bleibt die Ausgabe geschlossen.",
  "expiresAt": "2026-10-05T18:00:00"
}

### Change an announcement
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/announcements/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ausgabe geschlossen",
  "message": "Am Freitag und Samstag bleibt die Ausgabe geschlossen.",
  "expiresAt": null
}

### Delete an announcement
DELETE {{baseApiPath}}/announcements/1
